OL,3,AEight killed and others missing after
OL,4,Aferry capsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA search and rescue operation to find
OL,7,Fthe passengers still unaccounted for is
OL,8,Funder way, which Turkish authorities
OL,9,Fhave joined.
